WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/ai/AITripPlannerLLMAgent.tsx — a thin AI-stream wrapper:
    AITripPlannerLLMAgent = withAiFeature('trip-planner-llm-agent', InnerSection)
      • withAiFeature : AI-Off gate (ADR-015) — renders null when the per-feature flag is off.
      • InnerSection  : builds the POST body for `/ai/trips/plan/draft` from props
                        (vehicleId | string|number, origin?, destination?, currentSoc?, minArrivalSoc?,
                        chargeLimitSoc?, speedFactor?), drives useAiStream, renders the shared AIFeatureCard.
                        haveInputs = !!vehicleId && origin != null && destination != null.
                        body defaults: current_soc??80, charge_limit_soc??90, min_arrival_soc??20,
                        speed_factor??1.0, vehicle_id = Number(vehicleId)||0, origin/destination ⇒ {0,0,''} fallback.
    AIFeatureCard  : GlassPanel → title + Helix badge + description (+ emptyHint when !canStart) →
                     "Ask Helix" action (visible "Ask Helix"/"Helix is thinking…", aria "Ask Helix · <buttonLabel>",
                     disabled = !canStart||streaming) → AiOutputPanel.
    useAiStream    : idle → streaming → done|error (+ paused-confirm); accumulates delta text.
    AiOutputPanel  : hidden until anything; error line / thinking indicator / streamed prose.
  i18n keys extracted: tripPlanner.aiAgent.{title,description,generateButton,badge}; helix.{badge,tooltip,
                       ariaLabel,askHelix,thinking,errorLabel}; ai.common.errorUnknown.

